flowchart TD
  R1[Rep records return on order INVOICED PAID SHIPPED DELIVERED] --> R2{Batch in real allocation and qty within remaining}
  R2 -- no --> R3[Reject 400]
  R2 -- yes --> R4[Return PENDING returnedQty incremented]
  R4 --> R5{Independent approver decision}
  R5 -- reject with reason --> R6[REJECTED returnedQty released edit and resubmit]
  R6 --> R4
  R5 -- approve --> R7[APPROVED then publish SalesReturnCreated then POSTED]
  R7 --> R8{Line condition declared by requester}
  R8 -- SELLABLE --> R9[(WAREHOUSE pool sellable immediately no inspection)]
  R8 -- DAMAGED --> R10[Ledger row qty 0 goods vanish from books]
  R7 --> R11{Invoice fully paid}
  R11 -- no --> R12[creditedAmount increased]
  R11 -- yes --> R13[Credit rejected by accounting stock already restocked]
